          "name": "Infused Items",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Shirota carries the following infused items, which last for 24 hours or until the next time he makes his daily preparations:\n12 Alchemist's Fire (Greater)\n3 Blood Sight Elixir (Greater)\n12 Dread Ampoule (Greater)\n10 Elixir of Life (Major)\n5 Glue Bomb (Greater)",
