          "name": "Rebirth",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Frequency once per day\nEffect The veranallia spends a minute to encase a creature that has been dead for no more than a year in a cocoon. After 24 hours, the creature is restored to life, and the cocoon explodes in a shower of dust. If the veranallia chooses, Rebirth can change the creature's ancestry or heritage, typically into a skeleton.",
