          "name": "Wild Curse",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "The Dig Beast is loaded with cursed energy but also is hard to control. At the start of its turn, roll 1d6. On a 1–2 it is Slowed 1 until end of its turn, on a 3–4 it is neither slowed nor Quickened (unless from another effect), and on a 5–6 it is quickened until the end of its turn.",
