          "name": "Acid Breath",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The water scamp breathes acid that deals 2d6 acid damage in a 15-foot type:cone. Each creature in the area must attempt a check (reflex, dc:17, basic, options:area-effect) save. The water scamp can't use Acid Breath again for 1d4.",
