      "traits": [
        "gnome",
        "humanoid"
      ],
      "description": "Umbral gnome warriors are quick to charge into battle, but focus on defending their kin and their homes over more aggressive tactics when a choice is available. These warriors tend to work in groups and use their shields to intercept attacks.",
