          "name": "Manifest Dream Guardians",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger The door is opened\nEffect A group of four Animate Dreams manifest in the area just beyond the door. These four animate dreams each appear as vaguely whale-shaped but human-sized masses of tendrils. They swim through the air and attack the intruders at once, fighting to the death and pursuing any who flee the temple.",
