          "id": "7U1vBJC6Sw2EwvTd",
          "name": "Conditioned Response",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "If he hears a bell ring, Tumbo bites a nearby metal lead or (if one is not available) an adjacent creature at the beginning of his turn, if possible.",
